# Identical to the Hermit's: GMS gives both branches 200+8x% on three enemies,
# and both pulse every 900ms, for the reason given there. A dagger hangs in the
# air instead of a shuriken.
name: "Dark Flare"
description:
  "Release dark energy to summon a large dagger, which attacks enemies "
  "nearby."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CHIEF_BANDIT skill_order: 3 }
max_level: 20
max_enemies: 3
cast_interval_seconds: 0.9
base { skill_pct: 2.08 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.08 }
